  "authority_rules": [
    "PostNord maintains postcode assignment; DAGI Postnummerinddeling supplies postal geography and DAWA distributes a convenience view without becoming a new authority.",
    "The DAWA landpostnumre response is official current source evidence but its live cacheable URL and observed SHA-256 are not a publicly retained immutable release.",
    "The DAWA response omits ErGadepostnummer, valid-time and registration-time fields required by the country contract, so gadepostnummer must not be inferred from shape or code range.",
    "DAGI/DAWA postal geometry is not an administrative boundary, DAR address point, building footprint or cadastral surface.",
    "Invalid source rings or topology receive no automatic buffer, simplification, convex hull, municipality proxy or AGID-cell replacement.",
    "GL and FO stay in separate packs; no related routing or numeric range changes territory identity.",
    "Exact address or building display requires separate DAR/BBR/GeoDanmark source relationships."
  ]
